{"id": "unknown-2026-11-11-007", "date": "2026-11-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Trützschler to showcase advanced fibre processing at India ITME 2026", "content": "Trützschler Group will present fibre processing innovations at India ITME 2026 in Greater Noida from December 4 to 9, covering spinning, card clothing and nonwovens.\nHighlights include TC 26i, T-CAN, IDF 3 and TCO 21XL, which raises combing productivity by about 50 per cent.\nIt will also show cotton-cleaning, hygiene, wipes and technical nonwovens solutions for Indian manufacturers.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/tr-tzschler-to-showcase-advanced-fibre-processing-at-india-itme-2026-314935-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-11-008", "date": "2026-11-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Benninger to showcase resource-efficient dyeing solutions at ITME 2026", "content": "Benninger is presenting FabricMaster, SynthMaster and CPB Knit at India ITME 2026 for Indian mills seeking faster processing with lower water, energy and chemical use.\nThe systems cover woven and knitted goods such as sportswear, heavy jersey, synthetic blends and high-value underwear fabrics.\nCPB Knit offers salt-free dyeing with water use below one litre per kilogram.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/benninger-to-showcase-resource-efficient-dyeing-solutions-at-itme-2026-314933-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-11-009", "date": "2026-11-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cotton_price"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["[否定]slow", "[否定]pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Naphtha down 10%, PTA down 7%: Will polyester prices correct further?", "content": "Polyester staple fibre participants entered the second week of November under pressure as crude-linked feedstocks fell sharply while polyester yarn quotes eased more slowly.\nBetween November 3 and 5, naphtha fell up to 10.85 per cent across Far East Asia, Japan and Southeast Asia.\nParaxylene dropped about 7.8 per cent in Taiwan and Korea, passing cost relief to PTA within days.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/naphtha-down-10-pta-down-7-will-polyester-prices-correct-further--314928-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-11-010", "date": "2026-11-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.75, "keywords": ["decline", "pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["涉及財報", "情緒極端"]}, "title": "Under Armour bets on Football cleats and Tech Helix to reset its brand", "content": "Under Armour’s Q2 revenue fell 6.8 per cent year on year to $1.24 billion, with pressure across regions, channels and product categories.\nNorth America and international revenue each declined 7 per cent; apparel fell 6 per cent and footwear 11 per cent.\nIt is cutting SKUs, backing HeatGear, football cleats and Tech Helix, and licensing youth apparel to Centric Brands from autumn 2027.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_apparel", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/apparel-news/under-armour-bets-on-football-cleats-and-tech-helix-to-reset-its-brand-314930-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
